# Patterns lychee skips (regexes, one per line). Every entry needs a # reason above it.
# Careful with broad patterns: a `file://` pattern silently
# disables every relative-link check.

# github.com blob pages answer 503 to the runner's request burst (throttling, not dead links), and
# the monthly issue was mostly noise from them. Cost: a dead blob link goes unnoticed.
^https://github\.com/[^/]+/[^/]+/blob/
